        description: "A heavy brown swimmer of rivers and lakes, with a flat scaly paddle for a tail and webbed hind feet. The front teeth are orange and never stop growing, and they cut saplings both for food and for building. Lodges and dams of sticks and mud turn a flowing stream into a still pond. The fur is dense and dark, and the animal is awkward on land but powerful in the water.",
